;
 Changing the _atom_site_label data item value from 'C6' to 'C4' in order
 to correctly establish relationships between rows in different loops.

 Antanas Vaitkus,
 2018-08-08

 Renaming the _geom_torsion_site_symmetry_4 data item to _geom_torsion.
 The initial data name misassignment was cause by the incorrect data name
 order in the loop and the removal of data items containing only unknown
 ('?') or inapplicable ('.') values.

 Antanas Vaitkus,
